From: Daniel Martin <dmanlfc@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: qcom: sdm845-ayn-odin: make the touchscreen follow the panel

The TD4328 is a TDDI, so the touch half is in reset while the panel is
unprepared and its suspend write fails with -ENXIO, aborting s2idle.

---
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sdm845-ayn-odin.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/qcom/sdm845-ayn-odin.dts
@@ -632,6 +632,9 @@
 		vdd-supply = <&vreg_l28a_3p0>;
 		vio-supply = <&vreg_l14a_1p8>;
 
+		/* batocera - TDDI, follow the panel so suspend does not hit a reset chip */
+		panel = <&display_panel>;
+
 		syna,reset-delay-ms = <200>;
 		syna,startup-delay-ms = <200>;
 
